capcov features: <upstream>/packages/capabilities/examples/feature-model-authentication.json is a valid feature model
Authentication [auth] (root)
  Multi-Factor Authentication [mfa] (optional)
  Password [password] (mandatory)
    Second Factor [secondFactor] (optional, alternative group)
      Authenticator App [authenticatorApp] (group member)
      Passkey [passkey] (group member)
      SMS Code [sms] (group member)
